* DFHDCT: hand-written fixture (#5120), syntax per IBM DFHDCT p.368-385
* [CICS TS for OS/390 R3 Resource Definition Guide SC33-1684-30, ch.13]. No IBM table text or sample is reproduced.
DFHDCT   CSECT
         DFHDCT TYPE=INITIAL,SUFFIX=01
         DFHDCT TYPE=SDSCI,DSCNAME=AUDITDD,RECFORM=VARBLKA,            X
               BLKSIZE=1328,RECSIZE=132,TYPEFLE=OUTPUT
         DFHDCT TYPE=EXTRA,DESTID=AUDT,DSCNAME=AUDITDD
         DFHDCT TYPE=INTRA,DESTID=CSSL,DESTFAC=FILE,                   X
               TRANSID=CSML,TRIGLEV=5
         DFHDCT TYPE=INTRA,DESTID=PLAN,DESTRCV=LG
         DFHDCT TYPE=INDIRECT,DESTID=ALIA,INDDEST=CSSL
         DFHDCT TYPE=REMOTE,DESTID=RMTQ,SYSIDNT=SYSB,LENGTH=80
         DFHDCT TYPE=FINAL
         END
